      "en": "n8n has a good Google Sheets node — use it for the ordinary. Apps Script is better when you need something inside the file (menus, onEdit, complex formatting, custom functions), an event starting in the sheet itself, or work entirely inside Google. Both together: the sheet sends an event to n8n, and n8n does the rest."
